# zhvault harness

- Green gate is `make gate` + CI workflow `harness-gate` — see `docs/harness/build/gate.md`.
- Protocol taxonomy: `docs/harness/{python,frontend,build,config,ops}/` (map in `HARNESS.md`).
- Confirmed operator flows: `docs/harness/ops/` (update when backup/`--user`/deploy/gate change).
- Project Cursor hooks (`.cursor/hooks.json`) inject ops context and deny `git commit --no-verify`.
- Do not gut `ruff.toml` select, delete invariant tests, or no-op the CI workflow to force green.
- Do not instruct or use `--no-verify` to skip hooks.
- Extending invariants is fine; removing them requires human approval.
- See `docs/harness/anti-bypass.md`.
